# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# touchhole.part -- A hole that touches the foot of a leaning wall
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The hole touches one edge of the bottom of the block and breaks out
# through the wall above it, which leans in: the notch in the wall
# starts in a point.  OCCT cuts the same solid but joins its faces
# wrongly afterwards (fuzzer finding 0021).

profile p along z 0 4.5 1.5 10 4.5 0 10 0 0 0 0 0
extrude blk from 0 to 16 p draft 3.5
circle c 1 3.5 0.5 along z
extrude h from -3 to 17 c
subtract u blk h
